# Generated Rust code - DO NOT COMMIT
# Run `buf generate` to regenerate
/gen/rust/

# Build artifacts
build/

# NOTE: /gen/go/ and /gen/typescript/ ARE committed on purpose.
# Go services consume the generated Go code through the `github.com/opus-casino/proto`
# module (see the `replace` directive in each service's go.mod), and CI does not run
# `buf generate` before building. If these were ignored, every Go build, lint and
# security scan would fail to resolve `github.com/opus-casino/proto/gen/go/<svc>/v1`.